# Production runs releases (#2): scripts/deploy.sh is the only way code reaches the
# unit, and `systemctl restart` deploys nothing. -w waits, so the exit code is the
# deploy's (broker#123). run-deploy-command.sh appends the pushed SHA. Offered after
# every merge: decline it when the merge touched no RUNTIME_* path (AGENTS.md).
setsid -w scripts/deploy.sh
